      "description": "When the denylist last synced to Cloudflare successfully (restored after restarts on exporter 0.3.2 and later; exporter 0.3.1 shows No data after a restart until the next successful push). An old value means the Cloudflare sync is failing. No data: no successful Cloudflare sync recorded yet."
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Cloudflare feed age",
      "description": "Time since the last successful Cloudflare edge update, as tracked by the synchronizer (restored after restarts, refreshed every minute). Orange beyond 7h (missed 6h cycle), red beyond ABUSEIPDB_MAX_STALE_AGE (24h). No data: no successful Cloudflare sync recorded yet (exporter 0.3.1 exports 0 until then; the tile hides that 0).",
      "gridPos": {
