          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Bulk operation pending",
      "description": "Cloudflare allows one pending list bulk operation per account; a stuck pending operation delays the next update. Pending / last failed (1): a list bulk operation is being awaited (at most 2 minutes), or the last one failed, timed out or could not be polled, and stays 1 until the next successful Cloudflare push; a sustained 1 usually means the last bulk operation did not complete (see Cloudflare sync errors by reason: bulk, network). No (0): nothing outstanding. Unknown (0.3.2 and later): no bulk operation started and no Cloudflare push succeeded since the synchronizer started; exporter 0.3.1 exports 0 from the start.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 20,
        "y": 29,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 5
